function report(){const d=getDraft();const titles=['What did you observe?','When and where?','Review & safety check'];return `<main class="page"><div class="container">${introLine('COMMUNITY OBSERVATION','Report a turtle concern','Your careful observation can create a clear record. This is a fictional academic demo and does not notify any real conservation organization.')}<div class="form-layout"><section class="panel motion-in"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px"><div><div class="eyebrow">STEP ${reportStep} OF 3</div><h2 class="panel-title" style="font-size:23px;margin:9px 0 0">${titles[reportStep-1]}</h2></div><div class="pill">${Math.round(reportStep/3*100)}% complete</div></div><div class="form-progress">${[1,2,3].map(i=>`<div class="progress-segment ${i<=reportStep?'active':''}"></div>`).join('')}</div>${reportError?`<p class="error-text" role="alert">${esc(reportError)}</p>`:''}${reportStep===1?`<p class="help-text" style="margin-bottom:20px">Choose the closest category. Every report remains an <b>unverified observation</b>, not a diagnosis.</p><div class="incident-grid">${Object.entries(CATEGORIES).map(([key,text])=>`<button type="button" class="incident-option ${d.category===key?'selected':''}" data-action="select-category" data-id="${key}" aria-pressed="${d.category===key}">${icon(CATEGORY_ICONS[key],23)}<span>${text}</span></button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}
${reportStep===2?`<div class="two-col"><div class="field"><label for="observedAt">When did you observe it? *</label><input type="datetime-local" id="observedAt" data-field="observedAt" value="${esc(d.observedAt)}" max="${localDateTime()}" required></div><div class="field"><label for="publicZone">General area *</label><select id="publicZone" data-field="publicZone">${ZONES.map(z=>`<option value="${esc(z)}" ${d.publicZone===z?'selected':''}>${esc(z)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><div class="field"><label for="description">What did you notice? *</label><textarea id="description" data-field="description" maxlength="1200" placeholder="Describe what you observed from a safe distance...">${esc(d.description)}</textarea><small>At least 15 characters. Mention what you saw, not an assumed diagnosis.</small></div><div class="field"><div class="field-label">Observed conditions (optional)</div>${['Swimming unusually','Stationary or stranded','Fishing material nearby','Visible debris','Disturbance by people','Condition uncertain'].map(c=>`<label class="checkbox-line"><input type="checkbox" data-condition="${esc(c)}" ${d.observedConditions.includes(c)?'checked':''}>${esc(c)}</label>`).join('')}</div><div class="field"><label for="privateLocationNote">Additional location context (demo reviewer view only)</label><input id="privateLocationNote" data-field="privateLocationNote" maxlength="200" value="${esc(d.privateLocationNote)}" placeholder="Optional general context, no exact coordinates"><small>Never enter real nesting coordinates or personally identifying details.</small></div><div class="field"><div class="field-label">Photo evidence (optional)</div><div class="file-upload">${icon('file',26)}<div style="font-size:12px;font-weight:740;margin-top:9px">Choose a JPEG, PNG or WebP image</div><div class="tiny">One image, up to 5 MB; resized before local storage.</div><input type="file" id="photo-upload" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" aria-label="Upload observation photograph">${d.evidenceData?`<img class="upload-preview" src="${d.evidenceData}" alt="Locally selected evidence preview"><button type="button" data-action="remove-photo" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm mt">Remove image</button>`:''}</div></div>`:''}
${reportStep===3?`<div class="panel" style="background:#f7fbf9;box-shadow:none"><h3 class="panel-title">Your observation at a glance</h3><div class="case-data"><div><span class="data-label">Incident type</span><span class="data-value">${esc(CATEGORIES[d.category]||'Not selected')}</span></div><div><span class="data-label">Observed</span><span class="data-value">${esc(d.observedAt||'Not specified')}</span></div><div><span class="data-label">General area</span><span class="data-value">${esc(d.publicZone)}</span></div><div><span class="data-label">Description</span><span class="data-value user-authored">${esc(d.description)}</span></div><div><span class="data-label">Evidence</span><span class="data-value">${d.evidenceData?'One local demonstration image':'No image — optional'}</span></div></div></div><div class="notice warn mt">${icon('alert',21)}<span>Keep a safe distance. Do not touch, pursue, capture, move or treat wildlife. For a real urgent concern, contact the appropriate authorities. <b>This demo does not send any notification.</b></span></div><label class="checkbox-line mt" style="font-weight:740"><input type="checkbox" id="acknowledge" data-field="ack" ${d.ack?'checked':''}>I understand this is an unverified observation, and I should not approach or handle wildlife.</label>`:''}
<div class="form-actions">${reportStep>1?`<button data-action="report-back" class="btn btn-outline">${icon('back')} Back</button>`:`<span class="help-text">${icon('lock',14)} No account required</span>`}<button data-action="${reportStep===3?'submit-report':'report-next'}" class="btn">${reportStep===3?'Submit fictional report':'Continue'} ${icon('arrow',17)}</button></div></section><aside><div class="aside-photo">${photo('perhentian','aside-photo-img')}<div class="aside-photo-overlay"><span>FIELD GUIDE / 001</span><strong>Observe with care.</strong><small>Pulau Perhentian · Real location photography</small></div></div><div class="callout-side"><div class="feature-icon">${icon('shield',22)}</div><h4>Observe. Don't intervene.</h4><p>Remain at a safe distance, avoid disturbing turtles and share only what you actually witnessed. Your report is not a verified medical assessment.</p><div class="separator"></div><h4>What happens next?</h4><p>You'll receive a fictional reference number and a Turtle Rescue Passport. You can demonstrate how human reviewers and coordinators document each stage.</p></div><div class="panel mt"><h3 class="panel-title">Your data stays local</h3><p class="help-text">For this prototype, records are stored in your browser. No photos or reports are transmitted to conservation authorities or cloud servers.</p></div></aside></div></div></main>`;}
function success(id){const c=getCase(id);if(!c)return notFound('This report reference does not exist.');return `<main class="page"><div class="container"><div class="panel success-card motion-in"><div class="success-icon">${icon('checkcircle',42)}</div><div class="eyebrow mt">OBSERVATION SAVED LOCALLY</div><h1>Your concern has a record.</h1><p>Your fictional observation is now saved in this browser. No real-world wildlife team has been contacted.</p><div class="reference">${esc(c.id)}</div><div style="margin:10px 0 23px">${statusChip(c.status)}</div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn" href="#/passport/${esc(c.id)}">View Rescue Passport ${icon('arrow')}</a><button class="btn btn-outline" data-action="copy-reference" data-id="${esc(c.id)}">${icon('clipboard')} Copy reference</button><button class="btn btn-outline" data-action="new-report">New report</button></div><div class="notice mt" style="text-align:left">${icon('info')}<span>A reference is for this browser's demonstration records. It is not proof that a rescue team received your report.</span></div></div></div></main>`;}
function evidence(c){return c.evidenceData?`<img class="evidence-image" src="${esc(c.evidenceData)}" alt="Locally supplied illustrative observation evidence">`:`<div class="empty-photo illustration-ref">${photo('turtleClose','reference-photo')}<div class="reference-photo-note">${icon('info',16)}<span><b>No case photo uploaded</b><br>Reference species photograph only — not observation evidence.</span></div></div>`;}
function passport(id,print=false){const original=getCase(id);if(!original)return notFound('We could not find this case in this browser.');const role=getRole(),internal=role!=='reporter'&&!print,c=internal?original:publicCase(original),t=getTaskForCase(id),quality=completeness(original),suggestion=triage(original);return `<main class="page ${print?'print-page':''}"><div class="container">${!print?`<div class="page-head"><div><div class="label-line">CASE RECORD / TURTLE RESCUE PASSPORT</div><p class="page-lead" style="margin-top:10px">One observation. Every documented step. A transparent fictional case history.</p></div><div class="print-actions"><a href="#/track" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">${icon('search')} Track another</a><a href="#/print/${esc(id)}" class="btn btn-sm">${icon('file')} Print / Save as PDF</a></div></div>`:''}<div class="case-head"><div class="passport-header-image">${photo('turtle','passport-header-img')}<span>SPECIES PHOTO · NOT CASE EVIDENCE</span></div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#a6dcd1">${icon('turtle',15)} TURTLE RESCUE PASSPORT · FICTIONAL</div><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><h1>${esc(id)}</h1>${statusChip(c.status)}</div><div class="case-details"><span>${icon('waves',16)}${esc(CATEGORIES[c.category])}</span><span>${icon('pin',15)}${esc(c.publicZone)}</span><span>${icon('clock',15)}${fmt(c.createdAt)}</span></div></div>${c.status==='closed'?`<div class="outcome-banner"><b>${icon('checkcircle',18)} Documented case outcome: ${esc(DISPOSITIONS[c.disposition]||'Closed without reported outcome')}</b><p>This is a fictional case disposition, not proof of a real rescue or independently verified ecological impact.</p></div>`:''}
<div class="case-grid"><div class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Observation record</h2>${evidence(c)}<div class="separator"></div><div class="case-data"><div><span class="data-label">Concern</span><div class="data-value">${esc(CATEGORIES[c.category])}</div></div><div><span class="data-label">Observed at</span><div class="data-value">${fmt(c.observedAt)}</div></div><div><span class="data-label">Generalized zone</span><div class="data-value">${esc(c.publicZone)}</div></div><div><span class="data-label">Reporter observation</span><div class="data-value user-authored" style="font-weight:500">${esc(c.description)}</div></div><div><span class="data-label">Observed condition</span><div class="data-value">${esc(c.observedConditions?.join(', ')||'Not recorded')}</div></div>${internal&&c.privateLocationNote?`<div style="padding:11px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff3e3"><span class="data-label">Internal demo-only location context</span><div class="data-value user-authored">${esc(c.privateLocationNote)}</div></div>`:''}</div></div>
<div class="panel timeline-panel"><h2 class="panel-title">The complete case journey</h2><p class="panel-subtitle">Chronological record · ${c.events.length} documented actions · ${internal?'Internal demonstration view':'Public-safe view'}</p><div class="timeline">${c.events.map((e,i)=>`<div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot">${icon(i===c.events.length-1?'check':'clock',16)}</div><div class="timeline-body"><div class="timeline-title">${esc(e.title)}</div><div class="timeline-meta">${fmt(e.occurredAt)} · ${esc(e.actorRole==='system'?'System':e.actorRole.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+e.actorRole.slice(1))} demo role</div><p class="timeline-detail ${e.type==='reporter_reply'?'user-authored':''}">${esc(e.publicSummary)}</p>${e.evidenceData?`<div class="timeline-evidence"><img src="${esc(e.evidenceData)}" alt="Uploaded follow-up evidence for fictional case"><small>Optional follow-up evidence · Academic demo</small></div>`:''}${internal&&e.internalNote?`<div class="notice warn" style="padding:9px 11px">${icon('lock',14)}<span><b>Internal note:</b> <span class="user-authored">${esc(e.internalNote)}</span></span></div>`:''}</div></div>`).join('')}</div></div>
<div class="intelligence"><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Case intelligence</h2><div class="tiny" style="color:#759596;font-weight:800">RECOMMENDED DATA COMPLETENESS</div><div style="font-size:34px;color:#146e6b;font-weight:800;margin:8px 0">${quality.score}%</div><div class="bar-track" style="height:7px"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:${quality.score}%"></div></div><p class="help-text">Based on four transparent reporting checks, not scientific confidence.</p><div class="priority-box"><strong>${icon('bolt',15)} ${esc(suggestion.priority)}</strong><p>${esc(suggestion.reason)}</p></div><div class="data-label" style="margin-top:20px">Helpful information</div>${quality.missing.length?`<ul class="note-list">${quality.missing.map(s=>`<li>${esc(s)}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`:`<p class="help-text">All suggested observation fields recorded.</p>`}<p class="tiny text-muted">Rule-based decision support (demo). No computer vision or medical diagnosis.</p></section><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Next step</h2><p class="help-text">${nextStep(c.status)}</p><p class="help-text" title="${esc(translateText('Administrative demo age, not an emergency priority or response promise.'))}">${esc(translateText('Waiting on'))}: ${esc(translateText(caseAccountability(c).ownerLabel))} · ${caseAccountability(c).waitingHours.toFixed(1)}h</p>${!print?clarificationForm(c,role):''}${!print?`<div style="display:grid;gap:9px;margin-top:14px">${internal&&['submitted','under_review','needs_information'].includes(c.status)?`<a class="btn btn-soft" href="#/review?case=${encodeURIComponent(id)}">Open reviewer workspace ${icon('arrow')}</a>`:''}${internal&&['verified','assigned','in_progress','follow_up_recorded'].includes(c.status)?`<a class="btn btn-soft" href="#/response?case=${encodeURIComponent(id)}">Open response workspace ${icon('arrow')}</a>`:''}<button class="btn btn-outline" data-action="download-json" data-id="${esc(id)}">${icon('download')} Download safe JSON</button><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#/insights">${icon('chart')} View case insights</a></div>`:''}</section>${internal&&t?panel('Assigned demo team',`<div class="data-value">${esc(TEAMS.find(a=>a.id===t.assignedTeamId)?.name||'Fictional team')}</div><p class="help-text">${esc(t.actionType)}<br>Task: ${esc(t.id)}</p>`):''}</div></div><div class="print-only" style="margin-top:22px;font-size:11px;border-top:1px solid #888;padding-top:10px">${disclaimer} · Generated ${fmt(new Date().toISOString())}</div>${print?`<div class="print-actions no-print mt"><button class="btn" data-action="print-now">${icon('file')} Open print / Save as PDF</button><a class="btn btn-outline" href="#/passport/${esc(id)}">Return to passport</a></div>`:''}</div></main>`;}
function clarificationForm(c,role){
 const q=c.informationRequest;if(c.status!=='needs_information'||!q)return '';
 return `<div class="notice mt"><span><b>Clarification requested</b><br><span class="user-authored">${esc(q.question)}</span></span></div>${q.answeredAt?`<p class="help-text">Reply recorded. A human reviewer must assess it before verification.</p>`:role==='reporter'?`<form class="reply-form mt" data-case="${esc(c.id)}"><div class="field"><label for="reporter-reply">Additional observation details</label><textarea id="reporter-reply" name="reply" minlength="10" maxlength="2000" required placeholder="Share only what you observed safely. Do not include exact locations or personal information."></textarea></div><button type="submit" class="btn">Send clarification ${icon('arrow')}</button><p class="help-text">Reporter identity is simulated in this local demo.</p></form>`:''}`;
}
function nextStep(s){return {submitted:'Awaiting human review in this fictional demonstration.',under_review:'A reviewer can document verification or request more information.',needs_information:'A reporter can provide clarification in this passport. A reviewer must assess the reply.',verified:'A fictional authorized coordinator can assign a response task.',assigned:'The assigned task is ready to be started by a demo coordinator.',in_progress:'Record a simulated follow-up from the coordination workspace.',follow_up_recorded:'The coordinator can document the final fictional disposition.',closed:'This case has a documented ending. Its full history remains available.'}[s]||'Review the case history.';}
function notFound(message){return `<main class="page"><div class="container"><div class="panel center" style="max-width:600px;margin:50px auto;padding:55px"><div class="feature-icon" style="margin:0 auto">${icon('search',25)}</div><h1 class="page-title">Nothing here yet.</h1><p class="page-lead">${esc(message)}</p><div class="mt"><a href="#/" class="btn">Return home</a> <a href="#/track" class="btn btn-outline">Track another case</a></div></div></div></main>`;}
function track(){return `<main class="page"><div class="container page-simple">${introLine('CASE FOLLOW-UP','Find your Rescue Passport','Enter a fictional PenyuGuard reference stored in this browser to see its public-safe case journey.')}<div class="panel" style="padding:32px"><h2 class="panel-title">Look up a case</h2><form id="track-form" class="tracking-form"><input class="search-box" id="track-id" aria-label="Case reference" required placeholder="PG-2026-0001" autocomplete="off"><button class="btn" type="submit">${icon('search')} Track case</button></form>${trackError?`<p role="alert" class="error-text">${esc(trackError)}</p>`:''}<p class="help-text">Try <button type="button" class="btn btn-soft btn-sm" data-action="track-example">PG-2026-0001</button> for an illustrative example.</p><div class="notice mt">${icon('lock')}<span>This tool uses local demo data only; references from a different browser or device are not accessible. Public lookup excludes private demo notes.</span></div></div></div></main>`;}
function review(){const role=getRole(),chosen=pathNow().searchParams.get('case');if(role!=='reviewer')return roleGate('reviewer','Conservation Review','Switch into the Reviewer demo role to examine fictional observations and record human-led decisions.');const cs=getState().cases.slice().sort((a,b)=>Date.parse(b.createdAt)-Date.parse(a.createdAt));const c=getCase(chosen)||null;const m=metrics();return `<main class="page"><div class="container">${introLine('OPERATIONAL WORKSPACE','Conservation Review','Evaluate submitted observations, record transparent decisions and keep the Turtle Rescue Passport in sync.')}<div class="kpi-grid">${kpi('All reports',m.total,'layers','Stored locally')}${kpi('Awaiting review',m.awaiting,'clock','Submitted / in review')}${kpi('Need information',m.needsInfo,'info','Human follow-up')}${kpi('Reviewed records',m.reviewed,'checkcircle','With review timestamp')}</div>${actionError?`<div class="notice danger mb" role="alert">${icon('alert')} ${esc(actionError)}</div>`:''}<section class="panel"><div class="filter-bar"><input class="search-box" id="review-search" placeholder="Search case ID, category, area..." aria-label="Search cases"><select id="review-filter" aria-label="Filter review cases"><option value="all">All statuses</option>${Object.entries(STATUS).map(([k,v])=>`<option value="${k}">${esc(v)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Reference</th><th>Observation</th><th>General area</th><th>Status</th><th>Attention</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="review-body">${cs.map(c=>`<tr class="review-row" data-search="${esc(`${c.id} ${CATEGORIES[c.category]} ${c.publicZone}`.toLowerCase())}" data-status="${esc(c.status)}"><td><a class="case-link" href="#/review?case=${encodeURIComponent(c.id)}">${esc(c.id)}</a><br><span class="tiny">${dateOnly(c.createdAt)}</span></td><td>${esc(CATEGORIES[c.category])}</td><td>${esc(c.publicZone)}</td><td>${statusChip(c.status)}</td><td><span class="pill">${esc(triage(c).priority)}</span></td><td><a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="#/review?case=${encodeURIComponent(c.id)}">Review ${icon('chevron',14)}</a></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p id="review-no-match" class="help-text hide">No cases match these filters.</p></section>${c?`<div class="mt" id="review-detail">${reviewDetail(c)}</div>`:''}</div></main>`;}
function reviewDetail(c){const possible=possibleDuplicates(c),allowed=['submitted','under_review','needs_information'].includes(c.status);return `<div class="two-col"><section class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">SELECTED CASE</div><h2 class="panel-title" style="margin-top:9px">${esc(c.id)} ${statusChip(c.status)}</h2><div class="case-data"><div><span class="data-label">Concern</span><div class="data-value">${esc(CATEGORIES[c.category])}</div></div><div><span class="data-label">Original observation</span><div class="data-value user-authored">${esc(c.description)}</div></div>${c.privateLocationNote?`<div><span class="data-label">Internal-only location context</span><div class="data-value user-authored">${esc(c.privateLocationNote)}</div></div>`:''}</div><div class="priority-box"><strong>${esc(triage(c).priority)}</strong><p>${esc(triage(c).reason)}</p></div><div class="review-evidence-inline"><div class="data-label">Attached observation photograph</div>${c.evidenceData?`<img src="${esc(c.evidenceData)}" alt="Reporter-submitted fictional observation photo" class="review-evidence-photo">`:`<p class="help-text">No photo attached. Images are optional; use the original observation and human review.</p>`}</div><h3 class="panel-title" style="margin-top:22px">Potential duplicates</h3>${possible.length?possible.map(q=>`<p class="help-text"><a href="#/passport/${esc(q.id)}" style="color:#087e81;font-weight:800">${esc(q.id)}</a> — matching category, broad zone and observation time within six hours. Human judgment required.</p>`).join(''):`<p class="help-text">No matching candidate under the demo's six-hour rule. This does not prove uniqueness.</p>`}<a href="#/passport/${esc(c.id)}" class="btn btn-outline mt">Inspect full passport ${icon('arrow')}</a></section><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Review actions</h2>${c.status==='submitted'||(c.status==='needs_information'&&c.informationRequest?.answeredAt)?`<p class="help-text">Open this report for formal review. A decision requires a recorded rationale.</p><button data-action="transition" data-id="${esc(c.id)}" data-transition="start_review" class="btn">${icon('eye')} Begin / Resume Review</button>`:''}${c.status==='needs_information'?`<p class="help-text">${c.informationRequest?.answeredAt?'Reporter clarification received. Resume review to assess it.':'Waiting for the reporter to provide clarification in the public passport.'}</p>`:''}${c.events.filter(e=>e.type==='reporter_reply').map(e=>`<div class="notice mt"><span><b>Reporter clarification received</b><br><span class="user-authored">${esc(e.publicSummary)}</span></span></div>`).join('')}${c.status==='under_review'?`<form class="action-form" data-case="${esc(c.id)}"><div class="field"><label for="decision">Reviewer decision</label><select name="decision" id="decision"><option value="verify">Verified for Follow-up</option><option value="request_info">Needs More Information</option><option value="close_unsubstantiated">Unsubstantiated / Close</option><option value="close_duplicate">Duplicate / Close</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="note">Decision rationale (required)</label><textarea name="note" id="note" minlength="8" required placeholder="Explain what the fictional evidence supports..." style="min-height:90px"></textarea></div><div class="field" id="clarification-question-field" hidden><label for="clarification-question">Public-safe clarification question</label><textarea id="clarification-question" name="question" minlength="10" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Ask for safe observation details only. Your decision rationale remains private."></textarea></div><div class="field"><label for="duplicateOf">Duplicate case reference (only for duplicate decision)</label><select name="duplicateOfCaseId" id="duplicateOf"><option value="">Not applicable</option>${getState().cases.filter(q=>q.id!==c.id).map(q=>`<option value="${esc(q.id)}">${esc(q.id)} — ${esc(CATEGORIES[q.category])}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><button type="submit" class="btn">Record decision ${icon('check')}</button></form>`:''}${!allowed?`<div class="notice">${icon('checkcircle')}<span>This case is past the initial review stage. The recorded decision is ${esc(c.reviewDecision||'available in its passport')}.</span></div>${c.status==='verified'?`<a href="#/response?case=${esc(c.id)}" class="btn mt">Coordinate follow-up ${icon('arrow')}</a>`:''}`:''}<p class="help-text mt">All actions are fictional, appear in the passport timeline and cannot diagnose a turtle's condition.</p></section></div>`;}
function roleGate(role,title,copy){return `<main class="page"><div class="container"><div class="panel center" style="max-width:650px;margin:40px auto;padding:46px"><div class="feature-icon" style="margin:0 auto 17px">${icon('lock',25)}</div><h1 class="page-title">${title}</h1><p class="page-lead" style="margin:auto">${copy}</p><p class="notice warn mt" style="text-align:left">${icon('info')} This client-side role switch only changes the demonstration interface. It is not real authentication or access control.</p><button class="btn mt" data-action="switch-role" data-role="${role}">Switch to ${role==='reviewer'?'Reviewer':'Coordinator'} demo ${icon('arrow')}</button></div></div></main>`;}
function kpi(title,num,ic,sub){return `<div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-top"><span class="kpi-label">${title}</span>${icon(ic,19)}</div><div class="kpi-number">${num}</div><div class="kpi-note">${sub}</div></div>`;}
function response(){if(getRole()!=='coordinator')return roleGate('coordinator','Response Coordination','Switch into the Coordinator demo role to create fictional tasks and document follow-up outcomes.');const cs=getState().cases.filter(c=>['verified','assigned','in_progress','follow_up_recorded','closed'].includes(c.status));const id=pathNow().searchParams.get('case');const selected=getCase(id)||cs.find(c=>c.status==='verified')||cs[0];return `<main class="page"><div class="container">${introLine('COORDINATION WORKSPACE','Response & follow-up','Move verified cases through responsible fictional assignments, follow-up evidence and documented outcomes.')}<div class="notice warn mb">${icon('alert')}<span>No actual rescue dispatch occurs. All teams, assignments and outcomes are academic simulation records.</span></div>${actionError?`<div class="notice danger mb" role="alert">${icon('alert')} ${esc(actionError)}</div>`:''}<div class="two-col" style="grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.8fr) 1.3fr"><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Case pipeline</h2>${cs.map(c=>`<a href="#/response?case=${encodeURIComponent(c.id)}" class="case-mini" style="${selected?.id===c.id?'border-color:#0da49b;background:#f0faf6':''}"><div><div class="case-mini-title">${esc(c.id)}</div><div class="case-mini-sub">${esc(CATEGORIES[c.category])}</div></div>${statusChip(c.status)}</a>`).join('')||'<div class="empty-state">No reviewed cases yet.</div>'}</section><section class="panel">${selected?responseDetail(selected):`<h2 class="panel-title">Waiting for verified cases</h2><p class="help-text">Complete a human review before assigning a follow-up task.</p>`}</section></div></div></main>`;}
function responseDetail(c){const task=getTaskForCase(c.id);return `<div class="eyebrow">CASE COORDINATION</div><h2 class="panel-title" style="margin:12px 0 8px;font-size:23px">${esc(c.id)} ${statusChip(c.status)}</h2><p class="help-text">${esc(CATEGORIES[c.category])} · ${esc(c.publicZone)}</p><a href="#/passport/${esc(c.id)}" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm mb">View passport ${icon('chevron',15)}</a><div class="separator"></div>${c.status==='verified'?`<h3 class="panel-title">Assign an authorized fictional team</h3><form class="assign-form" data-case="${esc(c.id)}"><div class="field"><label for="team">Choose demo team</label><select name="team" id="team">${TEAMS.map(t=>`<option value="${t.id}">${esc(t.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="actionType">Follow-up activity</label><select name="actionType" id="actionType"><option value="Observation follow-up">Observation follow-up</option><option value="Review of available evidence">Review of available evidence</option><option value="Refer to appropriate authority">Refer to appropriate authority</option><option value="Document field assessment">Document field assessment</option></select></div><button type="submit" class="btn">Assign task ${icon('arrow')}</button></form>`:''}${task?`<div class="task-form"><span class="data-label">ACTIVE RESPONSE TASK</span><div class="data-value">${esc(task.id)} · ${esc(TEAMS.find(t=>t.id===task.assignedTeamId)?.name||'Fictional team')}</div><p class="help-text">${esc(task.actionType)} · ${esc(task.status.replaceAll('_',' '))}</p></div>`:''}${c.status==='assigned'?`<h3 class="panel-title mt">Begin fictional follow-up</h3><p class="help-text">A coordinator can mark the assigned task as started.</p><button class="btn" data-action="transition" data-id="${esc(c.id)}" data-transition="start_task">Start task ${icon('arrow')}</button>`:''}${c.status==='in_progress'?`<h3 class="panel-title mt">Record follow-up</h3><form class="followup-form" data-case="${esc(c.id)}"><div class="field"><label for="followup-note">What was documented?</label><textarea name="note" id="followup-note" minlength="8" required placeholder="E.g., Fictional observation reviewed; case prepared for referral..."></textarea></div><div class="field"><label for="followup-photo">Follow-up evidence photo (optional)</label><input id="followup-photo" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" data-case="${esc(c.id)}"><small>JPEG, PNG, or WebP, up to 5 MB; reduced for browser-local storage. This is fictional demo evidence, not a verified rescue photograph.</small><div id="followup-preview" class="followup-preview" aria-live="polite">${followUpPhotoData&&followUpPhotoCaseId===c.id?`<img src="${esc(followUpPhotoData)}" alt="Selected follow-up evidence preview"><span>Photo ready to save</span>`:'No follow-up photo selected'}</div><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" data-action="remove-followup-photo">Remove photo</button></div><button type="submit" class="btn">Save simulated follow-up ${icon('check')}</button></form>`:''}${c.status==='follow_up_recorded'?`<h3 class="panel-title mt">Close with documented disposition</h3><form class="close-form" data-case="${esc(c.id)}"><div class="field"><label for="disposition">Fictional case outcome</label><select name="disposition" id="disposition">${Object.entries(DISPOSITIONS).filter(([id])=>!['duplicate','unsubstantiated'].includes(id)).map(([k,v])=>`<option value="${k}">${esc(v)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="close-note">Closure rationale</label><textarea name="note" id="close-note" required minlength="8" placeholder="Record a factual note about this simulated disposition..."></textarea></div><button type="submit" class="btn">Close fictional case ${icon('checkcircle')}</button></form>`:''}${c.status==='closed'?`<div class="outcome-banner"><b>${icon('checkcircle')} Case closed</b><p>${esc(DISPOSITIONS[c.disposition]||'Documented outcome')}</p><a href="#/passport/${esc(c.id)}" class="btn btn-sm">View full case history</a></div>`:''}<p class="help-text mt">Every permitted action updates the same case record and appends a chronological event.</p>`;}
function insights(){const cs=getState().cases,m=metrics();const catCounts=Object.entries(CATEGORIES).map(([k,n])=>({k,n,v:cs.filter(c=>c.category===k).length}));const max=Math.max(1,...catCounts.map(x=>x.v));const statuses=Object.entries(STATUS).map(([k,n])=>({k,n,v:cs.filter(c=>c.status===k).length})).filter(x=>x.v);const sortedMonths=monthlyCounts(cs,getLocale()).map(x=>[x.label,x.count]);const safeCounts=ZONES.map(z=>[z,cs.filter(c=>c.publicZone===z).length]);return `<main class="page"><div class="container">${introLine('ILLUSTRATIVE CONSERVATION INTELLIGENCE','From records to insights','Explore how structured reporting and documented follow-ups create measurable operational indicators. All data here is fictional.')}<section class="insights-photo-banner">${photo('reef','insights-banner-img')}<div><span class="editorial-label light">A MORE INFORMED OCEAN</span><h2>Clarity begins with better records.</h2><p>Every chart reflects the fictional cases in this browser. No invented turtle rescue statistics.</p></div></section><div class="notice mb">${icon('info')}<span><b>Illustrative prototype data — not live conservation statistics.</b> Every number is computed from local cases and changes after a real demo action.</span></div><div class="kpi-grid">${kpi('Total observations',m.total,'layers','Fictional cases')}${kpi('Awaiting review',m.awaiting,'clock','Submitted / reviewing')}${kpi('Verified cases',m.verified,'shield','Human reviewer decision')}${kpi('Closed cases',m.closed,'checkcircle','Includes unsubstantiated')}</div><div class="kpi-grid">${kpi('Active tasks',m.activeTasks,'users','Not yet completed')}${kpi('Need more info',m.needsInfo,'alert','Awaiting clarification')}${kpi('Reviewed cases',m.reviewed,'eye','Recorded review timestamp')}${kpi('Median review time',m.medianHours===null?'—':`${m.medianHours.toFixed(1)}h`,'clock','Submission → review')}</div><div class="insight-grid"><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Observation categories</h2><p class="panel-subtitle">Breakdown of all fictional submitted cases</p>${catCounts.map(x=>`<div class="bar-row"><span>${esc(x.n)}</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:${x.v/max*100}%"></div></div><b>${x.v}</b></div>`).join('')}</section><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Case lifecycle</h2><p class="panel-subtitle">Current status, not distinct turtles or rescues</p><div class="donut-wrap"><div class="donut" style="background:conic-gradient(${donutGradient(statuses)})"><div class="donut-hole"><b>${m.total}</b><span>cases</span></div></div><div class="legend">${statuses.map((x,i)=>`<span><i style="background:${palette[i%palette.length]}"></i>${esc(x.n)} · ${x.v}</span>`).join('')}</div></div></section></div><div class="insight-grid mt"><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Generalized Perhentian zones</h2><p class="panel-subtitle">Stylized map schematic. Not real geolocated turtle points.</p><div class="zone-map">${zoneMap()}</div><div class="zone-chips">${safeCounts.map(([z,n])=>`<span>${esc(z)}: ${n}</span>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Reports by month</h2><p class="panel-subtitle">Counts reflect submission dates in the fictional dataset.</p>${sortedMonths.map(([mo,v])=>`<div class="bar-row" style="grid-template-columns:85px 1fr 23px"><span>${esc(mo)}</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:${v/Math.max(1,...sortedMonths.map(a=>a[1]))*100}%"></div></div><b>${v}</b></div>`).join('')}<div class="separator"></div><h3 class="panel-title">Latest case activity</h3>${cs.flatMap(c=>c.events.map(e=>({...e,caseId:c.id}))).sort((a,b)=>Date.parse(b.occurredAt)-Date.parse(a.occurredAt)).slice(0,5).map(e=>`<div class="health-row"><span><a style="font-weight:800;color:#15827e" href="#/passport/${esc(e.caseId)}">${esc(e.caseId)}</a><br><span class="tiny">${esc(e.title)}</span></span><span class="tiny">${dateOnly(e.occurredAt)}</span></div>`).join('')}</section></div></div></main>`;}
const palette=['#0e8383','#4bb3a5','#92cfc0','#b8bfa2','#d09b62','#6688a2','#c0e3d9','#8aaca8'];
function donutGradient(statuses){const sum=Math.max(1,statuses.reduce((a,x)=>a+x.v,0));let sofar=0;return statuses.map((x,i)=>{let from=sofar/sum*100;sofar+=x.v;return `${palette[i%palette.length]} ${from}% ${sofar/sum*100}%`;}).join(',')||'#e6efe9 0% 100%';}
function zoneMap(){return `<svg viewBox="0 0 610 320" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual schematic of fictional broad zones on Perhentian Kecil and Perhentian Besar, not geographical positions"><defs><linearGradient id="sea2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#c9ebe4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9dd5d2"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="610" height="320" rx="16" fill="url(#sea2)"/><g fill="none" stroke="#ffffff88"><path d="M-15 60Q180 0 360 100T650 70M-15 125Q180 65 360 165T650 135M-15 200Q180 140 360 240T650 210"/></g><path d="M160 52Q120 72 143 126L117 178Q110 240 164 264Q234 267 237 208L223 143Q262 95 206 65Z" fill="#65aa86" stroke="#f9f9dc" stroke-width="8"/><path d="M400 46Q354 58 344 111L318 181Q321 266 389 273Q447 273 465 215L477 147Q479 93 433 58Z" fill="#529c82" stroke="#f9f9dc" stroke-width="8"/><g fill="#e8f5e4" opacity=".55"><circle cx="185" cy="132" r="25"/><circle cx="386" cy="160" r="32"/></g><g font-size="14" font-weight="700" fill="#155d61" text-anchor="middle"><text x="183" y="295">Perhentian Kecil</text><text x="402" y="295">Perhentian Besar</text></g><circle cx="190" cy="188" r="8" fill="#0b7478" stroke="white" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="405" cy="115" r="8" fill="#0b7478" stroke="white" stroke-width="3"/><text x="17" y="25" fill="#226e76" font-size="11" font-weight="750">SCHEMATIC ONLY · NOT A REAL LOCATION MAP</text></svg>`;}
function demo(){const s=getState(),c=s.demoCaseId?getCase(s.demoCaseId):null;const steps=['Observe','Report','Passport','Review','Coordinate','Outcome'];const stage=c?({submitted:2,under_review:3,needs_information:3,verified:4,assigned:4,in_progress:4,follow_up_recorded:5,closed:6}[c.status]||2):1;let storage='Available';try{const k='pg-health';localStorage.setItem(k,'1');if(localStorage.getItem(k)!=='1')throw Error();localStorage.removeItem(k);}catch{storage='Unavailable';}return `<main class="page"><div class="container">${introLine('HACKATHON PRESENTATION MODE','Operation Safe Turtle','A complete, repeatable two-minute case lifecycle designed for judges. Every action follows the same application logic as a normal report.')}<div class="demo-photo-strip">${photo('perhentian','demo-real-img')}<span>${icon('pin',16)} ILLUSTRATIVE TURTLE FOOTAGE · FICTIONAL PERHENTIAN SCENARIO</span></div><div class="panel" style="background:#082f3b;color:white;border:0;padding:29px 33px"><div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#9de0cc">ALL CASES FICTIONAL · DEMO MISSION</div><h2 style="font-size:31px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:8px 0 10px">One observation. One complete story.</h2><p style="font-size:13px;color:#b9d6d3;line-height:1.7;max-width:680px">A fictional visitor notices fishing line near a turtle in a generalized snorkeling area. Follow the concern through reporting, human review, coordination and documented outcome.</p></div><button class="btn btn-light btn-lg" data-action="load-demo">${icon('bolt')} Load Demo Scenario</button></div><div style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap">${c?`<span class="pill">Active case: ${esc(c.id)} · ${esc(STATUS[c.status])}</span>`:`<span class="pill">No active demo case: load to start</span>`}<button class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" style="color:#fff;border-color:#719a97" data-action="reset-demo">${icon('reset')} Reset all local demo data</button></div></div><h2 class="panel-title mt">Guided demonstration journey</h2><div class="guided-steps">${steps.map((n,i)=>`<div class="guided-step" style="${i+1<=stage?'border-color:#77c6b5;background:#e8f7ef':''}"><div class="num">${i+1<=stage?icon('check',16):i+1}</div><span>${n}</span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="demo-split"><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Your next demonstration action</h2>${nextDemo(c)}<div class="separator"></div><h3 class="panel-title">120-second presentation outline</h3><ol class="note-list" style="font-size:13px"><li><b>0:00–0:15:</b> Show the problem and explain safe reporting.</li><li><b>0:15–0:40:</b> Load scenario and submit a fictional observation.</li><li><b>0:40–0:55:</b> Open the newly generated Rescue Passport.</li><li><b>0:55–1:15:</b> Switch to Reviewer and verify with a rationale.</li><li><b>1:15–1:35:</b> Assign, start and document a fictional follow-up.</li><li><b>1:35–2:00:</b> Show the updated passport, insights and print view.</li></ol></section><section class="panel"><h2 class="panel-title">Demo health check</h2>${[['Browser storage',storage],['Seeded sample passports',getCase('PG-2026-0001')?'Available':'Missing'],['Featured demo case',c?c.id:'Not yet loaded'],['Current demo role',getRole()],['Offline core app','No external API required']].map(([k,v])=>`<div class="health-row"><span>${esc(k)}</span><strong>${esc(v)}</strong></div>`).join('')}<div class="notice mt">${icon('shield')}<span>Role switching is only a presentation aid. No secure authentication or real dispatch exists in this demo.</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline mt" href="#/insights">Inspect live demo metrics ${icon('chart')}</a></section></div></div></main>`;}
function nextDemo(c){if(!c)return `<p class="help-text">Start with one click to preload the fictional observation into the reporting wizard. Submission remains a real form action.</p><button data-action="load-demo" class="btn">Load and open report ${icon('arrow')}</button>`;let stage=c.status;const map={submitted:['Switch to Reviewer and review the saved case','reviewer',`/review?case=${c.id}`],under_review:['Record a verification rationale','reviewer',`/review?case=${c.id}`],needs_information:c.informationRequest?.answeredAt?['Resume the review','reviewer',`/review?case=${c.id}`]:['Provide reporter clarification','reporter',`/passport/${c.id}`],verified:['Assign a fictional response team','coordinator',`/response?case=${c.id}`],assigned:['Start the response task','coordinator',`/response?case=${c.id}`],in_progress:['Record a simulated follow-up','coordinator',`/response?case=${c.id}`],follow_up_recorded:['Record the final disposition','coordinator',`/response?case=${c.id}`],closed:['Show the completed Rescue Passport','reporter',`/passport/${c.id}`]};const [label,role,path]=map[stage];return `<div class="notice">${icon('checkcircle')}<span>Featured case: <b>${esc(c.id)}</b>. Status: <b>${esc(STATUS[stage])}</b>.</span></div><button class="btn mt" data-action="demo-next" data-role="${role}" data-path="${esc(path)}">${esc(label)} ${icon('arrow')}</button><div class="mt"><a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="#/passport/${esc(c.id)}">View passport</a> <a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" href="#/insights">Updated insights</a></div>`;}
function captureActionForms(){return [...(document.querySelectorAll?.('form[data-case]')||[])].map(form=>({caseId:form.dataset.case,kind:form.className,fields:[...form.elements].filter(e=>e.name&&e.type!=='file').map(e=>({name:e.name,value:e.value}))}));}
function restoreActionForms(saved){for(const old of saved){const form=[...(document.querySelectorAll?.('form[data-case]')||[])].find(f=>f.dataset.case===old.caseId&&f.className===old.kind);if(!form)continue;for(const entry of old.fields){const el=form.elements.namedItem(entry.name);if(el)el.value=entry.value;}}updateQuestionField();}
function updateQuestionField(){const field=$('#clarification-question-field'),question=$('#clarification-question');if(field&&question){field.hidden=$('#decision')?.value!=='request_info';question.required=!field.hidden;}}
function render(){const savedForms=captureActionForms();const url=pathNow(),p=url.pathname,app=$('#app');let page;if(p==='/')page=landing();else if(p==='/report')page=report();else if(p.startsWith('/report/success/'))page=success(decodeURIComponent(p.split('/').at(-1)));else if(p.startsWith('/passport/'))page=passport(decodeURIComponent(p.split('/').at(-1)));else if(p.startsWith('/print/'))page=passport(decodeURIComponent(p.split('/').at(-1)),true);else if(p==='/track')page=track();else if(p==='/review')page=review();else if(p==='/response')page=response();else if(p==='/insights')page=insights();else if(p==='/demo')page=demo();else page=notFound('That page does not exist.');app.innerHTML=header()+page+footer();restoreActionForms(savedForms);startCinematicExperience();translateSubtree(app);document.documentElement?.setAttribute?.('lang',getLocale());document.title=(p==='/'?'PenyuGuard':translateText(({report:'Report',passport:'Turtle Rescue Passport',review:'Review',response:'Response',track:'Track case',insights:'Insights',demo:'Demo',print:'Print / Save as PDF'}[p.split('/').filter(Boolean)[0]]||p.split('/').filter(Boolean)[0]||'PenyuGuard'))+' · PenyuGuard');if(getStorageWarning())showToast(getStorageWarning(),true);}
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{menuOpen=false;actionError='';reportError='';render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});});window.addEventListener('pg:change',render);window.addEventListener('pg:locale',render);
function validateReportStep(step){const d=getDraft();if(step===1&&!d.category)return 'Please select what you observed.';if(step===2){if(!d.observedAt||isNaN(new Date(d.observedAt).getTime()))return 'Enter a valid observation date and time.';if(new Date(d.observedAt).getTime()>Date.now()+120000)return 'Observation time cannot be in the future.';if(!ZONES.includes(d.publicZone))return 'Select a valid generalized area.';if(d.description.trim().length<15)return 'Describe your observation in at least 15 characters.';}if(step===3&&!d.ack)return 'Please acknowledge the wildlife safety guidance.';return '';}
function renderSame(){render();}
async function processImage(file){if(!file)return;const types=['image/jpeg','image/png','image/webp'];if(!types.includes(file.type)){showToast('Choose JPEG, PNG or WebP only.',true);return;}if(file.size>5*1024*1024){showToast('Maximum image size is 5 MB.',true);return;}try{const img=new Image();const src=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const fr=new FileReader();fr.onload=()=>resolve(fr.result);fr.onerror=reject;fr.readAsDataURL(file);});await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{img.onload=resolve;img.onerror=reject;img.src=src;});const ratio=Math.min(1,960/Math.max(img.width,img.height));const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=Math.round(img.width*ratio);canvas.height=Math.round(img.height*ratio);canvas.getContext('2d').drawImage(img,0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);let data=canvas.toDataURL('image/jpeg',.65);if(data.length>550000){data=canvas.toDataURL('image/jpeg',.42);}if(data.length>550000)throw Error('Image too large after resizing; choose a smaller image.');getDraft().evidenceData=data;saveCurrentDraft();renderSame();showToast('Image added to local demo report.');}catch(e){showToast(e.message||'Could not process that image.',true);}}
async function processFollowUpImage(file,caseId){
 if(!file)return;
 if(!['image/jpeg','image/png','image/webp'].includes(file.type)||file.size>5*1024*1024){showToast('Follow-up photo must be JPEG, PNG, or WebP and no larger than 5 MB.',true);return;}
 try{
  const src=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>resolve(reader.result);reader.onerror=reject;reader.readAsDataURL(file)});
  const image=new Image();await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{image.onload=resolve;image.onerror=reject;image.src=src});
  const ratio=Math.min(1,960/Math.max(image.width,image.height));const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');canvas.width=Math.max(1,Math.round(image.width*ratio));canvas.height=Math.max(1,Math.round(image.height*ratio));canvas.getContext('2d').drawImage(image,0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);
  let data=canvas.toDataURL('image/jpeg',.65);if(data.length>550000)data=canvas.toDataURL('image/jpeg',.42);if(data.length>550000)throw Error('The resized photo is still too large. Choose a smaller image.');
  followUpPhotoData=data;followUpPhotoCaseId=caseId;const p=$('#followup-preview');if(p)p.innerHTML=`<img src="${esc(data)}" alt="Selected follow-up evidence preview"><span>${translateText('Photo ready to save')}</span>`;
  showToast('Follow-up image is ready. Save the follow-up to attach it to the case.');
 }catch(err){showToast(err.message||'Could not process the follow-up image.',true);}
}
async function secureDownload(id){const c=getCase(id);if(!c){showToast('Case not found.',true);return;}const safe=publicCase(c);const receipt=await createReceipt(safe,disclaimer);const b=new Blob([JSON.stringify(receipt,null,2)],{type:'application/json'});const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(b);a.download=`PenyuGuard-${id}-public-safe.json`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1500);}
async function actionTransition(id,action,payload={}){if(mutationPending)return false;mutationPending=true;try{if(pathNow().pathname==='/response'&&pathNow().searchParams.get('case')!==id)history.replaceState(null,'',location.pathname+location.search+'#/response?case='+encodeURIComponent(id));await withStorageLock(()=>transitionCase(id,action,payload));actionError='';showToast('Case updated; passport and insights are synchronized.');render();return true;}catch(e){actionError=e.message;showToast(e.message,true);render();return false;}finally{mutationPending=false;}}
document.addEventListener('click',async e=>{const control=e.target.closest('[data-action]');if(!control)return;const action=control.dataset.action;const id=control.dataset.id;e.preventDefault();switch(action){
case 'mobile-menu':menuOpen=!menuOpen;render();break;
case 'switch-role':setRole(control.dataset.role);showToast(`Switched to ${control.dataset.role} demonstration role.`);break;
case 'select-category':getDraft().category=id;reportError='';saveCurrentDraft();render();break;
case 'report-next':reportError=validateReportStep(reportStep);if(!reportError){reportStep=Math.min(3,reportStep+1);saveCurrentDraft();}render();break;
case 'report-back':reportStep=Math.max(1,reportStep-1);reportError='';saveCurrentDraft();render();break;
case 'remove-photo':getDraft().evidenceData='';saveCurrentDraft();render();break;
case 'remove-followup-photo':followUpPhotoData='';followUpPhotoCaseId='';if($('#followup-preview'))$('#followup-preview').textContent=translateText('No follow-up photo selected');if($('#followup-photo'))$('#followup-photo').value='';break;
case 'submit-report':{if(mutationPending)break;reportError=validateReportStep(3);if(reportError){render();break;}control.disabled=true;mutationPending=true;try{const d=getDraft();const c=await withStorageLock(()=>createReport({...d,observedAt:new Date(d.observedAt).toISOString()}));reportDraft=null;reportStep=1;reportError='';showToast(`Created ${c.id}.`);go(`/report/success/${c.id}`);}catch(err){reportError=err.message;control.disabled=false;render();}finally{mutationPending=false;}break;}
case 'new-report':reportDraft=freshDraft();reportStep=1;clearDraft();go('/report');break;
case 'copy-reference':try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(id);showToast(`Copied ${id}`);}catch{showToast(`Reference: ${id}`);}break;
case 'track-example':$('#track-id').value='PG-2026-0001';$('#track-id').focus();break;
case 'transition':await actionTransition(id,control.dataset.transition);break;
case 'download-json':try{await secureDownload(id);}catch{showToast('Export could not be prepared. Try again in a current browser.',true);}break;
case 'print-now':window.print();break;
case 'load-demo':{const existing=getState().demoCaseId?getCase(getState().demoCaseId):null;if(existing&&!confirm(getLocale()==='ms'?`Mulakan laporan demo baharu? Kes sedia ada ${existing.id} akan kekal dalam data.`:`Start a new demo report? Existing ${existing.id} will remain in the dataset.`))break;const sample={category:'entanglement',publicZone:'General Snorkeling Area',observedAt:localDateTime(),description:'During a fictional snorkeling observation, a green turtle appeared close to discarded fishing line. Potential entanglement was suspected but not confirmed. No one approached or touched the animal.',privateLocationNote:'Fictional context: broad snorkeling zone; no actual GPS point.',observedConditions:['Fishing material nearby','Condition uncertain'],evidenceData:'',ack:false,fromDemo:true};reportDraft=sample;reportStep=1;saveCurrentDraft();go('/report');showToast('Operation Safe Turtle is ready. Submit the form to generate its case.');break;}
case 'demo-next':setRole(control.dataset.role);go(control.dataset.path);break;
case 'reset-demo':if(confirm(getLocale()==='ms'?'Tetapkan semula semua kes dan tugasan PenyuGuard kepada 10 rekod rekaan asal? Laporan demo setempat anda akan dipadam.':'Reset all local PenyuGuard cases and tasks to the 10 fictional starting records? This deletes your own local demo submissions.')){try{await withStorageLock(()=>reset());}catch(err){showToast(err.message,true);render();break;}reportDraft=null;reportStep=1;go('/demo');showToast('Demo reset to original fictional data.');}break;
}});
document.addEventListener('input',e=>{const t=e.target;if(t.matches('[data-field]')){const d=getDraft(),name=t.dataset.field;if(name!=='ack'){d[name]=t.value;saveCurrentDraft();}}if(t.id==='review-search')filterReview();});
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{const t=e.target;if(t.id==='decision'){updateQuestionField();return;}if(t.id==='language-select'||t.id==='language-mobile'){setLocale(t.value);return;}if(t.id==='role-select'||t.id==='role-mobile'){setRole(t.value);showToast(`Demo role: ${t.value}. Not a secure login.`);return;}if(t.matches('[data-field]')){getDraft()[t.dataset.field]=t.type==='checkbox'?t.checked:t.value;saveCurrentDraft();}if(t.hasAttribute('data-condition')){const d=getDraft(),c=t.dataset.condition;d.observedConditions=t.checked?[...new Set([...d.observedConditions,c])]:d.observedConditions.filter(v=>v!==c);saveCurrentDraft();}if(t.id==='photo-upload'){processImage(t.files?.[0]);}if(t.id==='followup-photo'){processFollowUpImage(t.files?.[0],t.dataset.case);}if(t.id==='review-filter')filterReview();});
function filterReview(){const q=($('#review-search')?.value||'').toLowerCase().trim(),f=$('#review-filter')?.value||'all';let visible=0;document.querySelectorAll('.review-row').forEach(row=>{const yes=(!q||(row.dataset.search+' '+translateText(CATEGORIES[getCase(row.querySelector('.case-link')?.textContent)?.category]||'').toLowerCase()+' '+translateText(getCase(row.querySelector('.case-link')?.textContent)?.publicZone||'').toLowerCase()).includes(q))&&(f==='all'||row.dataset.status===f);row.classList.toggle('hide',!yes);if(yes)visible++;});$('#review-no-match')?.classList.toggle('hide',visible>0);}
document.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{const form=e.target;
if(form.id==='track-form'){e.preventDefault();const id=($('#track-id').value||'').toUpperCase().trim();if(getCase(id)){trackError='';go('/passport/'+encodeURIComponent(id));}else{trackError='No fictional case found under this reference in this browser.';render();$('#track-id').value=id;}return;}
if(form.matches('.reply-form')){e.preventDefault();await actionTransition(form.dataset.case,'reporter_reply',{reply:new FormData(form).get('reply')});return;}
if(form.matches('.action-form')){e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(form),a=f.get('decision');if(['close_unsubstantiated','close_duplicate'].includes(a)&&!confirm(getLocale()==='ms'?'Tutup kes rekaan ini dengan keputusan yang dipilih?':'Close this fictional case with the selected decision?'))return;await actionTransition(form.dataset.case,a,{note:f.get('note'),question:f.get('question'),duplicateOfCaseId:f.get('duplicateOfCaseId')});return;}
if(form.matches('.assign-form')){e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(form);await actionTransition(form.dataset.case,'assign_task',{teamId:f.get('team'),actionType:f.get('actionType')});return;}
if(form.matches('.followup-form')){e.preventDefault();await actionTransition(form.dataset.case,'add_follow_up',{note:new FormData(form).get('note'),evidenceData:followUpPhotoCaseId===form.dataset.case?followUpPhotoData:''});if(getCase(form.dataset.case)?.status==='follow_up_recorded'){followUpPhotoData='';followUpPhotoCaseId='';}return;}
if(form.matches('.close-form')){e.preventDefault();if(!confirm(getLocale()==='ms'?'Sahkan hasil penutupan kes rekaan ini?':'Confirm this fictional case disposition?'))return;const f=new FormData(form);await actionTransition(form.dataset.case,'close_case',{note:f.get('note'),disposition:f.get('disposition')});return;}
});
if(!location.hash)history.replaceState(null,'',location.pathname+location.search+'#/');render();
